        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "It unreal…\n\nA friend had said the best pecan pie he’s ever had is sold here, and the moment he said that I knew I had to try it…\n\nReason #1 being that he’s got great taste in food.\n\nReason #2 being that I love pecan pie.\n\n…and I can tell you that this pecan pie is NO JOKE.\n\nIt’s amazing and honestly the best pecan pie I’ve had to this day!\n\nI also pickup macaroons while there because everything looked so good and they do not disappoint at all!\n\nThere was one with this filling in the middle and I definitely need to head back for more of that also!",
        "time": 1639414780,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gary",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106398328657515995997/reviews",
