        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "The quality is top-tier, the taste is delicious.  What a wonderful bakery with a owner dedicated to nothing less then perfection.  Would highly recommend ordering a tasty cake or pie from them. Out of this world!!",
